# Kenwood TM-D750 over USB. The control head socket (USB id 2166:9030) carries the sound card and a
# serial port; that port becomes /dev/d750-cat, the CAT port d750d opens. The base unit socket
# (2166:9032) is a serial port only and becomes /dev/d750-tnc, the TNC's KISS port, which d750-aprs
# opens. Both are owned by the user named below.
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="2166", ATTRS{idProduct}=="9030", OWNER="@USER@", GROUP="uucp", MODE="0660", SYMLINK+="d750-cat"
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="2166", ATTRS{idProduct}=="9032", OWNER="@USER@", GROUP="uucp", MODE="0660", SYMLINK+="d750-tnc"
